      "items": {
        "what_it_does": {
          "score": 2,
          "quote": "NOIR 是一个跑在电脑上的审计工具，通过 `adb` 读取已连接 Android 设备的应用清单、权限和 APK 里的网络端点"
        },
        "who_it_is_for": {
          "score": 2,
          "quote": "定位：**审计与自我防护**。面向自己的设备、自己的应用、已授权的安全研究。"
        },
        "prerequisites": {
          "score": 2,
          "quote": "依赖：\n\n- **JDK 17+**\n- **Android platform-tools**（`adb`）\n- **jadx**（仅 `deep` 命令需要）"
        },
        "install_per_os": {
          "score": 2,
          "quote": "# macOS\nbrew install --cask android-platform-tools jadx\n\n# Debian / Ubuntu\nsudo apt install adb\n# jadx: https://github.com/skylot/jadx/releases\n\n# Windows (scoop)\nscoop install adb jadx"
        },
        "first_run_example": {
          "score": 2,
          "quote": "noir doctor\n```\n\n```\nNOIR doctor\n  platform  Mac OS X aarch64"
        },
        "config_and_keys": {
          "score": 1,
          "quote": "程序会自动在常见安装位置查找 `adb` 和 `jadx`；找不到时可以用 `--adb` / `--jadx` 指定。"
        },
        "troubleshooting_uninstall": {
          "score": 1,
